{"type":"message","id":"89e52b36","parentId":"aef30008","timestamp":"2026-04-27T06:40:38.161Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Doctor Agent audio screening result**\nHere is the preliminary result returned from the Doctor Agent based on your uploaded audio.\n\n**Depression screening result**\nThe voice-based depression screening suggests a **meaningful depressive symptom signal**, with **stress also appearing elevated** alongside it.\n\n**Confidence**\n**Moderate confidence.** This should be treated as a supportive screening result, not a final clinical conclusion.\n\n**Stress level**\n**Elevated.**\n\n**Interpretation**\nThis pattern can fit a **stress-related burden with depressive symptoms**, especially since your symptoms have been persistent rather than brief or situational only.\n\n**Important caution**\nThis is a **prototype preliminary signal only**. It is **not a diagnosis**, and it should be interpreted together with your symptoms, clinical history, and the rest of your assessment.\n\n**How this fits your broader case**\nThis result is broadly consistent with the rest of your case, including **poor sleep, fatigue, irritability, headaches, trouble concentrating**, and the earlier rise in **PHQ-9 score, stress index, and cortisol**. Taken together, the overall picture still suggests a **significant stress load with clinically meaningful depressive symptoms**.\n\n**Follow-up question**\nBased on the available DNA data, is **skin cancer risk still a concern** for you?\n\nIf yes, you can upload a **CT scan or a skin image** and I will run the **skin cancer detection pipeline** for a more in-depth analysis.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04ec2a99e9130d0b0169ef04e01fc48191a566bfc0c0d844dd\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":239,"output":296,"cacheRead":31232,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31767,"cost":{"input":0.0005975,"output":0.0044