{"type":"message","id":"8709224c","parentId":"7ad2a1e4","timestamp":"2026-04-27T06:42:43.011Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Doctor Agent skin review**\nI can give you a cautious preliminary read based on the image you uploaded and your stored dermatology/genetic background.\n\n**Skin cancer class**\n**Concerning pigmented lesion, preliminary only.**\n\n**Confidence**\n**Low to moderate.** This is limited by the fact that this is a single image and not a full structured dermatology exam.\n\n**Image Analyzer prediction**\nVisually, the spot appears **darkly pigmented with a darker central area, some irregular border features, and uneven distribution of color**, which makes it **not fully reassuring** on appearance alone.\n\n**CAM coverage**\nNot available.\n\n**CAM center ratio**\nNot available.\n\n**CAM left-right asymmetry**\nNot available as a numeric metric, but the lesion does appear **somewhat asymmetric** visually.\n\n**CAM top-bottom asymmetry**\nNot available as a numeric metric, but there appears to be **uneven shape and pigment spread** across the lesion.\n\n**CAM explanation**\nI do not want to invent exact pipeline metrics, but the main visually relevant features are **central darker pigmentation, fuzzy or irregular edges, and uneven color intensity**. Those are the kinds of features that make a lesion deserve closer attention in a melanoma-risk context.\n\n**Important caution**\nThis is a **prototype preliminary signal**, not a diagnosis. A single image cannot confirm or rule out skin cancer.\n\n**How this fits your background**\nBecause your records already show **CDKN2A-related melanoma susceptibility**, **MC1R-related UV sensitivity**, and a prior history of **increasing nevi count with atypical lesions under monitoring**, this image carries **more significance** than it would in a lower-risk background.\n\n**Suggested next step**\nIf you want, I can now recall the **distillation tool** to produce a **comprehensive medical report** of this whole conversation and the suggested next steps.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04ec2a99e9130d0b0169ef055b24048191a4d189f012289034\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":509,"output":380,"cacheRead":33792,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34681,"cost":{"input":0.0012725000000000002,"output":0.0057,"cacheRead":0.008447999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0154205}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777272152749,"responseId":"resp_04ec2a99e9130d0b0169ef05593b288191a68048b3dd234fca"}}
